$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Typical Procedures for Cu(II)-Mediated C-N bond formation. To a 15 mL
sealed tube was added substrates 1 ( 0.1 mmol, 1 equiv), Cu(OAc)2 (0.1
mmol), TsNH2 (0.2 mmol), Na2CO3 (0.2 mmol), DMSO (1 mL). The reaction
mixture was stirred at 80°C for 6 h under air. Upon completion, EtOAc was
added to dilute the mixture and then washed with NH3·H2O and saturated
NaCl(aq). The organic fraction was dried over Na2SO4, evaporated and
purified by flash column chromatography on silica gel with a gradient
eluent of hexane and ethyl acetate or dichloromethane and methanol.
N-(2-(4,5-dihydrooxazol-2-yl)phenyl)-2-methyl-6-(4-methylphenylsulfonamido)benzamide
(3b): white solid. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 12.05 (brs, 1H), 8.79 (dd, J
= 8.5, 0.9 Hz, 1H), 8.27 (brs, 1H), 7.88 (dd, J = 7.9, 1.6 Hz, 1H),
7.58-7.50 (m, 2H), 7.44-7.39 (m, 2H), 7.32 (t, J = 7.9 Hz, 1H), 7.18 (td,
J = 7.8, 1.2 Hz, 1H), 7.06 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 1H), 6.72 (d, J = 8.0 Hz, 2H),
4.37 (t, J = 9.7 Hz, 2H), 3.96 (t, J = 9.6 Hz, 2H), 2.36 (s, 3H), 2.02
(s, 3H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 166.57, 164.21, 143.05, 139.08,
136.46, 134.89, 134.87, 132.79, 130.66, 130.29, 129.22, 129.11, 128.48,
126.83, 123.44, 123.14, 119.67, 113.20, 66.15, 54.49, 21.15, 20.70; HRMS
(ESI-TOF) m/z Calcd for C24H23N3O4S [M+H]+ 450.1482, found 450.1485.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM regioselective, sealed tube used,aerobic
