$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 7-Amino-4,6-dinitro-1-phenyl-1H-indazole (2). Potassium tert-butoxide
(1.57 g, 14 mmol) was added to a solution of indazole 1 (1.99 g, 7 mmol)
and TMHI (2.83 g, 14 mmol) in DMSO (30 mL). The reaction mixture was
stirred at room temperature for 30 min, poured into water, and acidified
with concentrated HCl to pH = 4-5. The precipitate that formed was
filtered off, washed with hot EtOH, and dried in air. Compound 2 was
obtained. Yield 1.76 g (84%). M.p. 213-215 °C. Found (%): C, 52.37; H,
3.18; N, 23.23. C13H9N5O4. Calculated (%): C, 52.18; H, 3.03; N, 23.40.
1H NMR, δ: 7.50 (s, 2 H, NH2); 7.65-7.75 (m, 5 H, Ph); 8.71 (s, 1 H, CH);
8.88 (s, 1 H, H). 13C NMR, δ: 113.29, 113.72, 119.57, 119.72, 123.47,
127.61, 128.55, 129.84, 130.14, 134.21, 138.13, 138.67.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis of polycyclic fused heterocycles based on
4,6-dinitro-1-phenyl-1H-indazole
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
