= 176.0 (CO), 164.3 (CO), 152.3 (Cq), 132.8 (CHar), 131.3 (CHar), 126.6
(Cq), 125.9 (CHar), 122.1 (CHar), 55.2 (CH2), 38.6 (CMe3), 27.3 (CH3),
